Kamikaze Kitty (kkitty@netcom.com) wrote:
: I'm trying to setup NetHack on my g/f's Amiga 1200's HD. Not being 
: completely familiar with the Amiga, I ran into a bit of trouble getting 
: it configured to work off of the HD.  It works great off of floppy, but I 
: have no idea what I should set the various things in the config.  Right 
: now there are three directories on WORK: NetHack, HackExe, HackExe2 
: corisponding to which floppy the files should be on.
:   
:    Any help would be very much appreciated...

Now you should do the following assignments:

	assign nethack:	work:nethack
	assign hackexe:	work:hackexe
	assign hackexe2: work:hackexe2
	assign nethack: hackexe: add

and now you have the world createst game ready.

